ce**: \\(1 + 7 = 8\\).\n\n### Step 3: Write Down the Result\nPutting it all together, we get:\n```\n  133080260\n+  773801542\n-----------\n  907881802\n```\n\n### Final Answer\nThe sum of 133080260 and 773801542 is \\(\\boxed{907881802}\\).\n</|Assistant|>",
